{"strongs": "H0705", "word": "אַרְבָּעִים", "translit": "ar.ba.im", "root": "רבע", "morph": "H:N", "pos": "plural noun indeclinable", "gloss": "a forty", "definition": "אַרְבָּעִים 136 plural noun indeclinable a forty ; — 1. sine num. al.: \\ \\ a. usually apposition before noun, especially שָׁנָה , יוֺם (singular): אַרְבָּעִים שָׁנָה Judg 3:11 ; 1Sam 4:18 ; Amos 2:10 ; Amos 5:25 + 29 t.; יוֺם ׳ א Gen 7:17 ; 1Kgs 19:8 ; Jonah 3:4 + 6 t., יוֺם ׳ א לַיְלָה ׳ וְא Gen 7:4 ; Gen 7:12 ; Exod 24:18 + 7 t.; also בַּת ׳ א 1Kgs 7:38 , גָּמָל ׳ א 2Kgs 8:9 , אַמָּה ׳ א Ezek 41:2 and ( אַמָּה omitted) Ezek 46:22 , but בָּאַמָּה ׳ א 1Kgs 6:17 (v: אַמָּה ); אֶלֶף ׳ א Num 1:33 ; Num 2:19 ; Num 26:18 ; Josh 4:13 ; Judg 5:8 ; 2Sam 10:18 ; 1Kgs 5:6 ; 1Chr 12:37 ( van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:36 ), 1Chr 19:18 (see also below); rarely followed by plural noun, בָּנִים ׳ א Judg 12:14 , אֲדָנִים ׳ א Exod 26:19 ; Exod 26:21 ; Exod 36:24 ; Exod 36:26 ( P ). — (As round number Gen 7:17 ; Judg 3:11 ; Judg 5:31 ; Judg 8:28 ; 1Sam 4:18 +). \\ \\ b. after plural noun, ׳ פָּרוֺת א Gen 32:16 ( E ), ׳ שְׁקָלִים א Neh 5:15 . \\ \\ c. noun omitted Gen 18:29 , ׳ הָא v Gen 18:29 יַכֶּנּוּ ׳ א Deut 25:3 forty (blows) may he smite him. 2. with other numbers: \\ \\ a. before unit, + singular noun:, 40 + 1 שָׁנָה 1Kgs 14:21 ; 1Kgs 15:10 ; 2Kgs 14:23 40 + 2 שָׁנָה 2Chr 22:20 , אִישׁ 2Kgs 10:14 , עִיר Num 35:6 , + אֶלֶף Judg 12:6 40 + 5 שָׁנָה Josh 14:10 ( J E ), etc. (12 t.); + plural noun יְלָדִים 2Kgs 2:24 after plural noun הָעַמּוּדִים + 40 + 5 1Kgs 7:3 noun omitted 40 + 5 Gen 18:28 , compare Ezra 2:24 = Neh 7:28 . \\ \\ b. after unit, 9 + 40 שָׁנָה Lev 25:8 ( H ); 1 + 40 אֶלֶף Num 1:41 ; Num 2:28 , etc. (9 t. Numbers, P ). \\ \\ c. with hundreds, 40 שָׁנָה + 800 שָׁנָה Gen 5:18 ( P ); 100 + 40 שָׁנָה Job 42:16 + units, 7 שָׁנִים + 40 + 100 שָׁנָה Gen 47:28 ( P ); but (Ezra Nehemiah, mostly predicate, without noun), 900 + 40 + 5 Ezra 2:8 , compare v Ezra 2:25 ; Neh 7:62 , and ( ׳ א without וְ ) 600, 40 + 2 Ezra 2:10 , see also || Neh 7:15 ; Ezra 2:34 = Neh 7:36 ; Ezra 2:66 = Neh 7:68 (ver. omitted Baer Gi ), Neh 7:13 ; Neh 7:29 ; Neh 7:44 1000, 200, 40 + 7 Ezra 2:38 = Neh 7:41 plural noun 200 + 40 + 5 Neh 7:67 , plural noun 200, 40 + 2; Neh 11:13 also singular noun נֶפֶשׁ 700, 40 + 5 Jer 52:30 . 3. as ordinal, שָׁנָה ׳ בְּא Deut 1:3 in the fortieth year ; also ׳ בִּשְׁנַת הָא Num 33:38 ; 1Chr 26:31 וְאַחַת ׳ בִּשְׁנַת א 2Chr 16:13 in the forty-first year", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7720')\">BDB7720</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H705')\">H705</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7719')\">BDB7719</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7721')\">BDB7721</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַרְבָּעִים</bdbheb><sub>136</sub> <b>plural noun indeclinable</b> <highlightword>a forty</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> sine num. al.: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> usually apposition before noun, especially <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יוֺם</bdbheb> (singular): <bdbheb>אַרְבָּעִים שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 3:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,11)\">Judg 3:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,18)\">1Sam 4:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 2:10\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,10)\">Amos 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 5:25\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,25)\">Amos 5:25</ref> + 29 t.;<bdbheb>יוֺם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 7:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,17)\">Gen 7:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,8)\">1Kgs 19:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 3:4\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(32,3,4)\">Jonah 3:4</ref> + 6 t.,<bdbheb>יוֺם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לַיְלָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 7:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,4)\">Gen 7:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 7:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,12)\">Gen 7:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 24:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,18)\">Exod 24:18</ref> + 7 t.; also <bdbheb>בַּת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:38\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,38)\">1Kgs 7:38</ref>, <bdbheb>גָּמָל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,9)\">2Kgs 8:9</ref>, <bdbheb>אַמָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,2)\">Ezek 41:2</ref> and (<bdbheb>אַמָּה</bdbheb> omitted) <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,22)\">Ezek 46:22</ref>, but <bdbheb>בָּאַמָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:17\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,17)\">1Kgs 6:17</ref> (v: <bdbheb>אַמָּה</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>אֶלֶף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 1:33\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,33)\">Num 1:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,19)\">Num 2:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 26:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,26,18)\">Num 26:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 4:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,13)\">Josh 4:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 5:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,8)\">Judg 5:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,18)\">2Sam 10:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,6)\">1Kgs 5:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:37\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,37)\">1Chr 12:37</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:36\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,36)\">1Chr 12:36</ref>), <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,18)\">1Chr 19:18</ref> (see also below); rarely followed by plural noun, <bdbheb>בָּנִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 12:14\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(7,12,14)\">Judg 12:14</ref>, <bdbheb>אֲדָנִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,19)\">Exod 26:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 26:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,21)\">Exod 26:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,24)\">Exod 36:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,26)\">Exod 36:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). — (As round number <ref ref=\"Gen 7:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,17)\">Gen 7:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 3:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,11)\">Judg 3:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 5:31\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,31)\">Judg 5:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,28)\">Judg 8:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,18)\">1Sam 4:18</ref> +). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> after plural noun, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פָּרוֺת א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,16)\">Gen 32:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׁקָלִים א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 5:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,5,15)\">Neh 5:15</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> noun omitted <ref ref=\"Gen 18:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,29)\">Gen 18:29</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הָא</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Gen 18:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,29)\">Gen 18:29</ref> <bdbheb>יַכֶּנּוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 25:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,25,3)\">Deut 25:3</ref> <highlight>forty (blows) may he smite him.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> with other numbers: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> before unit, + singular noun:, 40 + 1<bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,21)\">1Kgs 14:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 15:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,15,10)\">1Kgs 15:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,23)\">2Kgs 14:23</ref> 40 + 2 <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Chr 22:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,22,20)\">2Chr 22:20</ref>, <bdbheb>אִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:14\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,14)\">2Kgs 10:14</ref>, <bdbheb>עִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 35:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,6)\">Num 35:6</ref>, + <bdbheb>אֶלֶף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 12:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,12,6)\">Judg 12:6</ref> 40 + 5 <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 14:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,14,10)\">Josh 14:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), etc. (12 t.); + plural noun <bdbheb>יְלָדִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:24\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,24)\">2Kgs 2:24</ref> after plural noun <bdbheb>הָעַמּוּדִים</bdbheb> + 40 + 5 <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,3)\">1Kgs 7:3</ref> noun omitted 40 + 5 <ref ref=\"Gen 18:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,28)\">Gen 18:28</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:24\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,24)\">Ezra 2:24</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:28\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,28)\">Neh 7:28</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> after unit, 9 + 40 <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,8)\">Lev 25:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>); 1 + 40 <bdbheb>אֶלֶף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 1:41\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,41)\">Num 1:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:28\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,28)\">Num 2:28</ref>, etc. (9 t. Numbers, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> with hundreds, 40 <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> + 800 <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 5:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,18)\">Gen 5:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); 100 + 40 <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 42:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,42,16)\">Job 42:16</ref> + units, 7 <bdbheb>שָׁנִים</bdbheb> + 40 + 100 <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 47:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,28)\">Gen 47:28</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); but (Ezra Nehemiah, mostly predicate, without noun), 900 + 40 + 5 <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:8\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,8)\">Ezra 2:8</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"Ezra 2:25\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,25)\">Ezra 2:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 7:62\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"62\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"62\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,62)\">Neh 7:62</ref>, and (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> without <bdbheb>וְ</bdbheb>) 600, 40 + 2 <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,10)\">Ezra 2:10</ref>, see also || <ref ref=\"Neh 7:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,15)\">Neh 7:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:34\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,34)\">Ezra 2:34</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:36\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,36)\">Neh 7:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:66\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"66\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"66\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,66)\">Ezra 2:66</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:68\" b=\"16\